      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِرْمًى</span></b>  <i>An instrument for throwing,</i> or <i>casting,</i>
or <i>shooting:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَامٍ</span>. (Har p. 54.) [Hence,]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَامِى نِيرَانٍ</span> [<i>Engines for throwing fire</i> upon the
enemy]. (S and K voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرَّاقَةٌ</span>.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِرْمَاةٌ</span>.]

